@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Filter the team by status
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Teammate" as actor
box "Frontend — Mondino web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "Segmented" as chips
  participant "TeamPage" as page
  participant "filterByStatus" as fn
  participant "TeamTable" as table
  participant "ListNote" as note
  participant "Router" as router
  participant "Clock" as clock
end box
actor -> chips : Move with the arrow keys and choose "Working now"
chips -> chips : Roving focus in one tab list; aria-selected on the chosen tab (L2-028)
chips -> page : valueChange("working")
page -> router : navigate /team?filter=working, replacing the entry
router --> page : queryParamMap filter = working (L2-028)
page -> fn : filterByStatus(rows, 'working')
fn --> page : Rows whose statusFor is Working hours, still west to east;\na teammate who does not share their status is under All only
alt at least one row
  page -> table : rows, caption "Teammates in working hours, west to east"
  table --> actor : The teammates in working hours
else no row for Working now
  page -> note : "No one is in working hours right now"
  note --> actor : The note, with "It’s the quiet gap between time zones.\nCheck back in an hour." and "Show everyone"
else no row for Asleep
  page -> note : "No one is asleep right now", "Try another filter."
  note --> actor : The note, with "Show everyone", which returns to All
end
== The clock passes an hour that changes a status ==
clock -> page : Minute tick
page -> page : Recompute rows, counts and visibleRows (L2-028)
page -> chips : New counts
page -> table : New rows
table --> actor : The list and the counts change with no reload
@enduml
